/P 88 0 R
/E (This work presents a deterministic system for verifying narrative consistency over long-form texts, using full novels as a proxy for real-world long-context reasoning challenges. The task is reframed from language generation or entailment to logical consistency checking over time-indexed symbolic facts.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
