346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The key contribution is a strict separation of perception and reasoning: LLMs are used only to extract structured signals from text, while all final decisions are made through explicit, rule-based constraints. Narrative events are converted into irreversible symbolic states, enabling deterministic and explainable evaluation of hypothetical backstories.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
